{"about_the_game":"Detective Story - is a simple quest game, with hardoce elements,  where you play as a detective Harold. You look for clues, interview witnesses and collect everything to clear a crime.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe plot of the game is easy. It is a mixed story about a detective who had sworn to devote kindness and help everybody in need. The main mission here is to investigate a strange murders chain in a small town Sherwood. Look for clues, interview witnesses, get out from various mazes with traps, and collect information. Finally, you will find the one who makes all these murders.<br />\r\nThe game has two endings, happy and sad. Only you are the person making a decision about the ending. Good luck!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1515280?t=1764924387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1515280?t=1764924387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764924387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764924387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of unrealistic violence and blood."},"detailed_description":"<h1>FIND HMUR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.poster.avif?t=1764924387\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.webm?t=1764924387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.mp4?t=1764924387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Detective Story - is a simple quest game, with hardoce elements,  where you play as a detective Harold. You look for clues, interview witnesses and collect everything to clear a crime.<br><br>The plot of the game is easy. It is a mixed story about a detective who had sworn to devote kindness and help everybody in need. The main mission here is to investigate a strange murders chain in a small town Sherwood. Look for clues, interview witnesses, get out from various mazes with traps, and collect information. Finally, you will find the one who makes all these murders.<br>The game has two endings, happy and sad. Only you are the person making a decision about the ending. Good luck!","developers":["LTZinc"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515280/header.jpg?t=1764924387","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1515280/339854/cc21ec493e8058364f59adc030a8d19c54f32d9e/1750997509/dash_av1.mpd?t=1610401793","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1515280/339854/cc21ec493e8058364f59adc030a8d19c54f32d9e/1750997509/dash_h264.mpd?t=1610401793","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1515280/339854/cc21ec493e8058364f59adc030a8d19c54f32d9e/1750997509/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1610401793","id":256817853,"name":"ds","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256817853/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1610401793"}],"name":"Detective Story","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a p